PRINCIPLE AUDITED

map_first_constrain_later_enum_last_if_needed: true

The map records the principle as: Map first, constrain later, enum last if
still needed.

CANONICAL AXES AUDITED

The Option A map separates these axes:

- artifact_type
- source_artifact_type
- EvidenceItem.kind / evidence_kind
- TraceRef.kind
- lifecycle_state / status
- authority_status

Audit interpretation:

- artifact_type is semantic metadata / classification only.
- source_artifact_type is audit/lifecycle/proof source metadata only.
- EvidenceItem.kind remains local ResultProposal evidence
  classification/source/provenance.
- TraceRef.kind is trace metadata and not EvidenceItem.kind.
- lifecycle_state / status records process state.
- authority_status records whether an artifact can decide anything.

