WHAT THIS FIXES

- Creates a canonical human-readable vocabulary baseline.
- Separates artifact_type from source_artifact_type.
- Separates artifact_type from EvidenceItem.kind / evidence_kind.
- Separates TraceRef.kind from evidence.
- Separates lifecycle_state / status from artifact_type.
- Separates authority_status from artifact naming.
- Records Root-only final-output authority guardrails.

WHAT THIS DOES NOT FIX

- Does not implement runtime enforcement.
- Does not create runtime constants.
- Does not create schema enum.
- Does not create a runtime artifact registry.
